Attacks are unlocked after completing 15 [[Trials|trials]]. A new tab is added with a new revolution type, Attack Circles. For every Attack Level, there is an enemy, depicted as an HP bar on the top of the screen. Your goal is to deal enough damage to deplete the enemy's HP bar and advance to the next Attack Level.

There are a total 5 Attack Circles and they work similarly to the [[Revolution|base game's circles]]. Every revolution/lap increases the Attack Circle's Attack Damage Multiplier on the top of the screen. In addition, each revolution/lap counts as a hit to the enemy, dealing damage to its HP bar.

When you Unite and get a new Zodiac, the Attack Level gets reset to 0 and you will be rewarded with the amount of Gold that is shown at the bottom of the screen. Your Circle Attack Multipliers will NOT be reset upon Uniting and performing a Soft Unity Reset (by e.g. swapping Zodiacs) will not reset Attack Level.

